{"ref":"passive:stone-mask","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Stone Mask is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by finding it as a stage item for the first time."]},{"k":"p","c":["Stone Mask increases ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}," by 10% per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Stone Mask is required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Gatti Amari","r":"weapon:gatti-amari"},", ",{"t":"Vicious Hunger","r":"weapon:vicious-hunger"},". It is also required for the evolution of ",{"t":"Night Sword","r":"weapon:night-sword"},", ",{"t":"Muramasa","r":"weapon:muramasa"},", in which Stone Mask must also be fully leveled."]},{"k":"p","c":["Stone Mask can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Inlaid Library","r":"stage:inlaid-library"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Mt.Moonspell","r":"stage:mt-moonspell"},", and ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["2 January 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["GREED"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Inlaid Library","r":"stage:inlaid-library"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Mt.Moonspell","r":"stage:mt-moonspell"},", ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Stone Mask has 5 levels. At max level, Stone Mask provides +50% ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["\"Character earns 10% more coins.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Coins value increases by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Coins value increases by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Coins value increases by 10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Coins value increases by 10%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gatti_Amari.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:gatti-amari"},"\n",{"t":"Gatti Amari","r":"weapon:gatti-amari"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":20,"h":16,"r":"passive:stone-mask"},"\nStone Mask"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Vicious_Hunger.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:vicious-hunger"},"\n",{"t":"Vicious Hunger","r":"weapon:vicious-hunger"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Night_Sword.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:night-sword"},"\n",{"t":"Night Sword","r":"weapon:night-sword"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":20,"h":16,"r":"passive:stone-mask"},"\nStone Mask"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Muramasa.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:muramasa"},"\n",{"t":"Muramasa","r":"weapon:muramasa"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Jet_Black_Whip.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:jet-black-whip"},"\n",{"t":"Jet Black Whip","r":"weapon:jet-black-whip"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":20,"h":16,"r":"passive:stone-mask"},"\nStone Mask"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Mormegil_Tip.png","w":30,"h":32,"r":"weapon:mormegil-tip"},"\n",{"t":"Mormegil Tip","r":"weapon:mormegil-tip"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Rock_Riot.png","w":28,"h":32,"r":"weapon:rock-riot"},"\n",{"t":"Rock Riot","r":"weapon:rock-riot"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":20,"h":16,"r":"passive:stone-mask"},"\nStone Mask"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gemma_Torpor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:gemma-torpor"},"\n",{"t":"Gemma Torpor","r":"weapon:gemma-torpor"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sanguine_Star.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:sanguine-star"},"\n",{"t":"Sanguine Star","r":"weapon:sanguine-star"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":20,"h":16,"r":"passive:stone-mask"},"\nStone Mask\n+\nBlood Rage tech"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Blood_Chalice.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:blood-chalice"},"\n",{"t":"Blood Chalice","r":"weapon:blood-chalice"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Stone Mask is not vital for winning a run, but rather getting the most money out of it. If you find yourself unable to finish a run, it is wise to avoid taking the Stone Mask unless you are already set up for the late game."]},{"c":["Stone Mask increases the value of the coin also increases how much they can heal with ",{"t":"Disco of Gold (XV)","r":"arcana:disco-of-gold-xv"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 2 January 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Stone Mask is a two-tiered reference, both to the ",{"t":"Castlevania","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania"}," series, and more directly, to the ",{"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure"}," series: most Castlevania games since Symphony of the Night have had a ",{"t":"Stone Mask","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Stone_Mask"}," as a piece of wearable equipment, along with a number of other JoJo references, due to the series’ creator, Koji Igarashi, being a devoted fan of JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure. The origin of the item itself is found within the JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure series, in which they were ",{"t":"ancient tribal masks","x":"https://jojowiki.com/Stone_Mask"}," that transformed anyone who wore them into vampires, and which one of the series’ antagonists, Dio Brando, notably uses for that reason, rejecting his humanity."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}